        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "连续第六次来到年终总决赛，对手却并不好打。赛前交手，穆霍娃三比二领先。这一场，先看谁能守住机会。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "78ab9c81b6db0e79c3e50962e4fadfffcbd2a00fb5272dbec8ab4c49ba1d5f05",
